# Chrome Mox: "{T}: Add one mana of any of the exiled card's colors." Emrakul, the Aeons Torn is colorless, so a Mox that
# imprints it has no color to add (CR 106.5): Bot1 imprints it, taps the Mox, and the Mox is tapped with no mana in the
# pool. Bot1 therefore cannot pay for the Mountain-less Lightning Bolt, which stays in hand.

[Bot1 Deck]
Chrome Mox
Emrakul, the Aeons Torn
Lightning Bolt
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Chrome Mox.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Emrakul, the Aeons Torn)
Bot1.Battlefield.Chrome Mox.Activate
? Bot1.Mana =
? Bot1.Battlefield.Chrome Mox.Tapped = true
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Exile = Emrakul, the Aeons Torn
Bot1.Hand = Lightning Bolt; Island; Island; Island; Island
Bot2.Life = 20
